---
---

<section id="alerte" class="cta-band">
  <div class="oq-container">
    <div class="cta-card">
      <div class="cta-copy">
        <h2>Soyez prévenu avant tout le monde.</h2>
        <p>
          Recevez les nouveaux mandats Off Market par email, dès leur mise en
          vente. Pas de spam, une notification par bien — uniquement quand
          un nouveau bien correspond.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-bullets">
          <span>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Sans engagement
          </span>
          <span>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            1 email par bien max
          </span>
          <span>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Désinscription en 1 clic
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <form class="cta-form" method="POST" action="/api/leads">
        <label class="oq-label" for="cta-email">Votre email</label>
        <input id="cta-email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="prenom.nom@email.com" required class="oq-input" />
        <label class="oq-label" for="cta-budget" style="margin-top: 12px;">Budget indicatif</label>
        <input id="cta-budget" name="budget" type="text" placeholder="Ex. 200 000 € — 500 000 €" class="oq-input" />
        <button type="submit" class="oq-btn oq-btn-primary" style="width: 100%; margin-top: 16px;">M'alerter en priorité</button>
        <div class="fine">
          En soumettant ce formulaire, vous acceptez de recevoir nos alertes
          par email.
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta-band { padding: 80px 0 96px; background: #fff; }
  .cta-card {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--gradient-oqoro);
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 64px 56px;
    color: #fff;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .cta-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    right: -100px;
    top: -100px;
    width: 380px;
    height: 380px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(247, 104, 99, 0.4) 0%, rgba(247, 104, 99, 0) 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .cta-card .cta-copy { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .cta-card h2 {
    font-size: 44px;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -1.5px;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .cta-card p {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    max-width: 460px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .cta-bullets {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .cta-bullets span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .cta-form {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 24px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
  }
  .cta-form .fine {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--fg-tertiary);
    margin-top: 10px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .cta-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 48px 32px; }
    .cta-card h2 { font-size: 34px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .cta-band { padding: 56px 0 64px; }
    .cta-card { padding: 36px 24px; }
    .cta-card h2 { font-size: 28px; }
  }
</style>
